AI Project Development Phase

1. Introduction

The AI Project Development Phase focuses on developing an artificial intelligence-based system using suitable algorithms, datasets, and programming tools.

2. Objectives

- Develop an AI-based solution for the identified problem.
- Collect and prepare the required dataset.
- Apply suitable machine learning algorithms.
- Train and evaluate the AI model.
- Integrate the AI model into the application.

3. Data Collection

Relevant data is collected from suitable sources to train and develop the AI model.

4. Data Preprocessing

The collected data is cleaned, organized, and transformed into a suitable format for model development.

5. Algorithm Selection

Suitable AI or machine learning algorithms are selected based on the project requirements and dataset.

6. Model Training

The AI model is trained using the prepared dataset to identify patterns and generate predictions.

7. Model Evaluation

The model is evaluated using appropriate metrics to check its performance and accuracy.

8. System Integration

The developed AI model is integrated into the application to provide the required functionality.

9. Expected Outcome

A functional AI-based system capable of solving the identified problem using artificial intelligence techniques.

10. Conclusion

The AI Project Development Phase transforms the project idea into an AI-based solution through data preparation, model development, training, and evaluation.
